  <a class="btn btn-o" href="#calc">Get started</a>
</div></nav>

<header class="hero"><div class="wrap">
  <div>
    <div class="tag">🏡 Rates from 4.19% · Decision in principle in 10 mins</div>
    <h1>The home you want, with a mortgage that <em>fits your life.</em></h1>
    <p>Whether you're buying your first home, moving up or remortgaging, AcmeBank gives you clear rates, no hidden fees and a dedicated mortgage adviser from start to keys.</p>
    <div class="cta"><a class="btn btn-o" href="#calc">Calculate repayments</a><a class="btn btn-g" href="#products">Explore mortgages</a></div>
    <div class="stats"><div><b>120k+</b><small>Homeowners helped</small></div><div><b>4.8★</b><small>Customer rating</small></div><div><b>£0</b><small>Arrangement fee options</small></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="calc" id="calc">
    <h3>Mortgage calculator</h3><p>Estimate your monthly repayment in seconds.</p>
    <label>Property price <output id="pv">£300,000</output></label><input type="range" id="price" min="50000" max="1500000" step="5000" value="300000">
    <label>Deposit <output id="dv">£30,000</output></label><input type="range" id="dep" min="0" max="500000" step="1000" value="30000">
    <label>Interest rate <output id="rv">4.19%</output></label><input type="range" id="rate" min="1" max="10" step="0.01" value="4.19">
    <label>Term <output id="tv">25 years</output></label><input type="range" id="term" min="5" max="40" step="1" value="25">
